cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software in your work, please cite it together with the
  reference book that inspired the toolbox. Note: this toolbox is unofficial
  and not endorsed by the book's author.
title: "Data-Driven Control Toolbox"
abstract: >-
  A MATLAB/Simulink toolbox implementing the data-driven and adaptive control
  methodologies presented in Ali Khaki-Sedigh's "An Introduction to
  Data-Driven Control Systems" (Wiley, 2024): DeePC, MFAC, Unfalsified
  Switching Control (single- and multi-model), SPSA, Self-Tuning Regulators,
  and VRFT. All stateful algorithms are matlab.System classes usable both as
  Simulink blocks and as plain MATLAB objects.
keywords:
  - MATLAB
  - Simulink
  - data-driven control
  - DeePC
  - MFAC
  - UFC
  - SPSA
  - STR
  - VRFT
  - adaptive control
